{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>And your male slave and your female slave who shall be yours.</b> If you say: If so, with what shall I serve? Over my own slaves I do not rule, from the nations I do not inherit — for You have warned me, ״לֹא תְחַיֶּה כָּל נְשָׁמָה״; so who will serve me?" "<b>From the nations.</b> These shall be yours for slaves (ibid.)." "<b>Who are around you.</b> And not those within the border of your land, for concerning them I said ״לֹא תְחַיֶּה כָּל נְשָׁמָה״."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:28.803715786Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}